        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Charlotte Hornets, UNLV Runnin' Rebels, NCAA Division I, Mountain West Conference\n- People: Larry Johnson\n- Places: Thomas & Mack Center, Paradise, Nevada, Las Vegas, United States\n- Events: 1991 NBA draft\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1991 NBA draft, the Charlotte Hornets used the top overall pick to select UNLV star Larry Johnson.\n- The UNLV Runnin' Rebels are an NCAA Division I men's basketball team.\n- The UNLV Runnin' Rebels play at the Thomas & Mack Center in Paradise, a suburb of Las Vegas, Nevada, United States.\n- The Thomas & Mack Center is the home arena of the UNLV Runnin' Rebels basketball team.\n- The UNLV Runnin' Rebels compete in the Mountain West Conference.",
